{"id":"00209","root":"uni00209_1","name":{"ja":"アイナ・ウィンチェスター","en":"Aina Winchester"},"title":{"ja":"【真夏の眼帯】","en":"【Midsummer Eyepatch】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【真夏の眼帯】 アイナ・ウィンチェスター","en":"【Midsummer Eyepatch】 Aina Winchester"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-06-30","limited":true,"characterId":41,"profile":{"ja":"幼いころ両親を魔族に殺され、自身も片目を抉り取られる拷問を受けるが、米連兵に助けられた。しかし孤児となった彼女を引き取ろうとする親戚はおらず、孤児院に預けられる。その後米連のアカデミーを卒業したが、軍には入らず、両親を殺した魔物を追う孤独なハンターとなり、魔族退治を生業とする。アカデミーで習得した戦闘技術を駆使して数多の魔族を退治するうち、米連の軍内部にも彼女の名が知れ渡るようになった。現在では軍と提携をし、物資の援助を受けながら任務を遂行している。今回は初の日本における任務を請け、日本に出向している。また、今回の任務が終われば『とある実験』への参加を求められている。趣味は筋トレと射撃、銃の手入れ。好きな食べ物は栄養補助バーと牛乳。","en":"Aina Winchester was orphaned when demons killed her parents and gouged out one of her eyes, but she was rescued by the United States forces. With no relatives willing to take her in, she was placed in an orphanage. After graduating from the U.S. academy, she chose not to join the military and instead became a lone hunter, tracking down the monsters that murdered her parents and making demon extermination her livelihood. Using the combat techniques she learned at the academy, she has slain countless demons, and her name has become known even within the U.S. military. She now works in partnership with the army, receiving logistical support while carrying out missions. This is her first assignment in Japan, and after it ends she will be asked to take part in \"a certain experiment.\" Her hobbies are weight training, shooting, and maintaining her firearms. Her favorite foods are nutrition bars and milk."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"榎津まお","forms":[{"id":"uni00209_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1096,2192],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[133,266],"def":[104,208],"spd":[88,88],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["3","240001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00209_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","